<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel FELS appoints new director.</title>
<headline>Keppel FELS appoints new director.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel FELS, the offshore rigbuilding and repair unit of Keppel Corp, said on Monday it has appointed Tan Kim Siew as a director with effect from March 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Tan, 43, is the chief executive officer and chief planner of the government's Urban Redvelopment Authority (URA).</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
